      "The existing engine recomputes features, forecasts and anomaly scores for the full 216-hour window on every refresh, although only the newest hour changes. Model inference for the decision hour alone measured 0.487 s at 10,000 agents. Caching earlier hours' features and scores would avoid most of that recomputation; it is not implemented or measured here (no redesign in this phase).",
